---
// TLDR.astro - Displays the TL;DR section for WestWorld
---
<section id="tldr" class="content-section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">TL;DR</h2>

    <div class="tldr-card">
      <figure class="teaser-frame">
        <a href="/teaser_image.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <img
            src="/teaser_image.png"
            alt="WestWorld teaser: one trajectory world model learning dynamics across diverse robotic systems"
            class="teaser-image"
            width="1672"
            height="705"
          />
        </a>
      </figure>

      <ul class="tldr-points">
        <li>
          We propose <strong>WestWorld</strong>, a novel <strong>system-aware MoE architecture</strong> for scaling up the training of trajectory world models across diverse robotic systems.
        </li>
        <li>
          We introduce <strong>knowledge-encoded structural embedding</strong> that provides an explicit inductive bias to enhance <em>zero- and few-shot generalization</em> to unseen robotic systems.
        </li>
        <li>
          We conduct <strong>extensive experiments</strong> to verify the scalability and generalizability of our method, and apply it to a downstream <strong>model-based control task</strong>, demonstrating strong performance in <em>long-horizon planning</em>.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tldr-card {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 1rem auto 3rem auto;
    background-color: white;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .tldr-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  /* Framed teaser: soft tinted mat so the figure's white panels stand out */
  .teaser-frame {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.9rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef3fc 0%, #e6edf9 100%);
    border: 1px solid #d6e0f2;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .teaser-frame a {
    display: block;
  }

  .teaser-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background-color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(42, 47, 108, 0.1);
  }

  .tldr-points {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0 0;
    padding: 1.5rem 1rem 0.25rem 2.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #eceff6;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #333;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .tldr-points li {
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .tldr-points li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .tldr-points em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #555;
  }

  .tldr-points strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #2a2f6c;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .tldr-card {
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .teaser-frame {
      padding: 0.5rem;
    }

    .tldr-points {
      padding: 1.25rem 0.25rem 0 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
